{"id":"n62602-1-7","stage":4,"title":"서술어 · 谓语","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62602-1-7-1","ko":"이 문장에 들어갈 서술어의 알맞은 형태는 무엇일까요?","zh":"这个句子应该填入什么形式的谓语？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"문장에","meaning":"文章","explanation":"문장：文章；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"문장","audio":"/audio/22f146433241fd2aa3fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57177","senseId":"2","lemma":"문장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문장에","audio":"/audio/ab7da088baff2b1a251a.mp3"}},{"text":"들어갈","meaning":"包含，插入，夹进","explanation":"들어가다：包含，插入，夹进；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"5","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어갈","audio":"/audio/8e2d25fce03474b34354.mp3"}},{"text":"서술어의","meaning":"谓语","explanation":"서술어：谓语；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"서술어","audio":"/audio/bc1f37d63d5b7d7f5be0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62602","senseId":"1","lemma":"서술어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서술어의","audio":"/audio/23f2cc86706ae7947d6f.mp3"}},{"text":"알맞은","meaning":"适当，适合","explanation":"알맞다：适当，适合；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"알맞다","audio":"/audio/180956544ad52c423d54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71501","senseId":"1","lemma":"알맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알맞은","audio":"/audio/63fa0a11093f7a1740f9.mp3"}},{"text":"형태는","meaning":"形态，样子","explanation":"형태：形态，样子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"형태","audio":"/audio/e1b56dd677111a7f491e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86382","senseId":"1","lemma":"형태","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형태는","audio":"/audio/50f9094f8f7a891691fd.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇일까요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇일까요","audio":"/audio/d7d3ff296a585d0d8617.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"22f146433241fd2a","term":"문장","zh":"文章","audio":"/audio/22f146433241fd2aa3fe.mp3","entryId":"57177","definition":"通过叙述、疑问、命令、感叹等形式，表示一个完整的意思的，组成语言与文章的基本单位。","pronunciation":["문장"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"包含，插入，夹进","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"被插到某物内。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"bc1f37d63d5b7d7f","term":"서술어","zh":"谓语","audio":"/audio/bc1f37d63d5b7d7f5be0.mp3","entryId":"62602","definition":"句子中表示主语的性质、状态、动作等的话。","pronunciation":["서ː수러"]},{"id":"180956544ad52c42","term":"알맞다","zh":"适当，适合","audio":"/audio/180956544ad52c423d54.mp3","entryId":"71501","definition":"正符合一定基准、条件或程度，不超过也不欠缺。","pronunciation":["알ː맏따"]},{"id":"e1b56dd677111a7f","term":"형태","zh":"形态，样子","audio":"/audio/e1b56dd677111a7f491e.mp3","entryId":"86382","definition":"事物的模样。","pronunciation":["형태"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd53c82025dd77731725.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62602-1-7-2","ko":"음, 글쎄요. 너무 어려워서 잘 모르겠어요.","zh":"嗯，这个太难了，我不太清楚。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음,","meaning":"嘿","explanation":"음：嘿。","readings":[{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71111","senseId":"2","lemma":"음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}},{"text":"글쎄요.","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说。","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"어려워서","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려워서","audio":"/audio/c8db6e35c7bfcab56762.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어요","audio":"/audio/262161281aabff06df61.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95e3c75cd502220b","term":"음","zh":"嘿","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3","entryId":"71111","definition":"不满意或担心时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["음"]},{"id":"b6013caa74979f40","term":"글쎄요","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3","entryId":"60633","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄요"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4639b46ba2dccfd9c847.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62602","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，这个太难了，我不太清楚。","这座山的山顶上有一块巨大的岩石。","这个句子应该填入什么形式的谓语？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，这个太难了，我不太清楚。","这个句子应该填入什么形式的谓语？","这座山的山顶上有一块巨大的岩石。"],"answer":0}]}
